  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u53942d32\" id=\"u53942d32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5eb6d29f\" id=\"u5eb6d29f\">想象一条街上有很多房子，每个房子里面住着不同的家庭。这些家庭需要接收信件，比如水电账单或快递包裹。但邮递员不能一次把信件送到所有的房子里，他需要一个一个地按顺序送到每个房子。这条街就是IIC通信的**总线**，而每个房子就是不同的电子元件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud378f569\" id=\"ud378f569\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e4ef6c3\" id=\"u8e4ef6c3\">​</span><br></p><ol list=\"u000254bd\"><li fid=\"u85c439e6\" data-lake-id=\"u309c37b0\" id=\"u309c37b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2136a482\" id=\"u2136a482\">IIC怎么工作？</span></strong></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u571c62b4\" id=\"u571c62b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u252bbd02\" id=\"u252bbd02\">IIC通信就像是邮递员送信到这些房子：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud435a6c0\" id=\"ud435a6c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc0b49ea\" id=\"ucc0b49ea\">每个房子（电子元件）都有自己的地址，邮递员（控制器）通过街道（IIC的两根线）来给每个房子送信。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u7292aa80\" id=\"u7292aa80\">邮递员会先看看信上的地址，确定应该送到哪一家（这就像IIC中的“寻址”）。然后他把信送到那个房子。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u8dc787c7\" id=\"u8dc787c7\">每次，邮递员只能给一个房子送信。其他房子虽然也在这条街上，但他们要等到邮递员送完这一家后再轮到自己。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u16802d2c\" id=\"u16802d2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u434dcb17\" id=\"u434dcb17\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub9a6bcb3\" id=\"ub9a6bcb3\">2. 街道上的两根“线”</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28fcdc3c\" id=\"u28fcdc3c\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u8d35ac0a\" id=\"u8d35ac0a\">在IIC这条“街道”上，有两根非常重要的“线”：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud19d8253\" id=\"ud19d8253\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87992ab8\" id=\"u87992ab8\">SDA线：就像是邮递员手里拿着信件的信息线，信件的内容（信息）会通过这根线传到房子里。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u338f2a66\" id=\"u338f2a66\">SCL线：这是帮助邮递员按时送信的“时钟线”，就像街上的路灯，照亮邮递员什么时候该送信。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u40e654f3\" id=\"u40e654f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e8af860\" id=\"u2e8af860\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5053df9e\" id=\"u5053df9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ec23857\" id=\"u0ec23857\">下面看一下在micropython中如何使用i2c</span></p><ol list=\"u0b3a8612\"><li fid=\"u8d2f5e8d\" data-lake-id=\"u908cea26\" id=\"u908cea26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a4b7f1b\" id=\"u3a4b7f1b\">导包</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Pin%2C%20I2C%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22avElg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u0b3a8612\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u8d2f5e8d\" data-lake-id=\"u00f12c1f\" id=\"u00f12c1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77ffbe4c\" id=\"u77ffbe4c\">初始化引脚</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i2c%20%3D%20I2C(0%2C%20scl%3DPin(2)%2C%20sda%3DPin(1)%2C%20freq%3D400000)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22quZT1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u0b3a8612\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u8d2f5e8d\" data-lake-id=\"u27052bfd\" id=\"u27052bfd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueeeb1e61\" id=\"ueeeb1e61\">调用scan()函数，搜索设备</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ret%20%3D%20i2c.scan()%5Cn%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84i2c%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%5Cnprint(ret)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IRkbV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua4e719aa\" id=\"ua4e719aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u336774f2\" id=\"u336774f2\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7b0e1879\" id=\"u7b0e1879\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7da8a95f\" id=\"u7da8a95f\">参考文档：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"bookmarkInline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.micropython.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2Fesp32%2Fquickref.html%23hardware-i2c-bus%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.micropython.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2Fesp32%2Fquickref.html%23hardware-i2c-bus%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.micropython.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2F_static%2Ffavicon.ico%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.micropython.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2F_images%2Fesp32.jpg%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Quick%20reference%20for%20the%20ESP32%20%E2%80%94%20MicroPython%20latest%20documentation%22%2C%22belong%22%3Anull%2C%22belong_url%22%3Anull%2C%22desc%22%3Anull%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.micropython.org%2Fen%2Flatest%2Fesp32%2Fquickref.html%23hardware-i2c-bus%22%2C%22extra%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ItVvL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"YsPq9\" id=\"YsPq9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4bffca8\" id=\"uc4bffca8\">点亮IIC屏幕 </span></h2><h3 dat